  {
   "host": "KEV",
   "text": "It's the Fryer Radio midweek special! 4 nights down in week 1!"
  },
  {
   "host": "NIGEL",
   "text": "I'm Nigel. Everything you're about to hear comes from the banked box scores. No vibes. Well, some vibes."
