   "text": "Projected finish: Danna 5 4. Still live: rebounds and assists."
  },
  {
   "host": "KEV",
   "text": "Can we address what Danna just pulled out of the hat?"
  },
  {
   "host": "NIGEL",
   "text": "The assists category. Going into night 4, Bizzle was winning it 73 percent of the time. Danna then put up 64 assists in one night, to Bizzle's 50. It's now 41 percent."
  },
  {
   "host": "KEV",
   "text": "That is a bullshit rabbit out of a bullshit hat! 64 assists! In one night!"
  },
  {
