   "text": "And the star of the show for Danna this week? Ty Jerome. A 5 dollar waiver pickup. 45 points, then 28. 2 games, 37 a night."
  },
  {
   "host": "NIGEL",
   "text": "38 in a night from Paul George, and Danna is paying him 1 dollar."
  },
  {
   "host": "KEV",
   "text": "Silver lining, Bizzle: Danna left 91 points on the bench on night 4. Kyrie Irving among them. Imagine if they'd set the lineup properly!"
  },
  {
   "host": "NIGEL",
   "text": "Biggest nights in this one: Anthony Edwards with 45, and Ty Jerome with 45."
