   "text": "The rebounds category. Going into night 2, Slav was winning it 50 percent of the time. Mamba then put up 84 rebounds in one night, to Slav's 41. It's now 22 percent."
  },
  {
   "host": "KEV",
   "text": "84 rebounds! That's not a fantasy lineup, that's a magic show!"
