  {
   "host": "KEV",
   "text": "Silver lining, Slav: Mamba left 115 points on the bench on night 2. Darius Garland among them. Imagine if they'd set the lineup properly!"
  },
  {
   "host": "NIGEL",
   "text": "Biggest nights in this one: Giannis Antetokounmpo with 36, and Tyrese Maxey with 32."
  },
  {
   "host": "NIGEL",
   "text": "For Mamba to steal it, they need 3 more categories to flip. The only live one is turnovers."
